@startuml model-download-flow
title Model Download Flow

actor User
participant "ModelSelectionScreen" as UI
participant "ModelDownloadManager" as Manager
participant "RemoteModelSource" as Remote
database "HuggingFace" as HF
database "Local Storage" as Storage

== Check for Updates ==
User -> UI: Tap "Check for Updates"
UI -> Manager: checkForUpdates()
Manager -> Remote: fetchAllRemoteModels()
loop For each ModelSource
    Remote -> HF: GET /api/models/{owner}/{repo}/tree/main
    HF --> Remote: JSON file list
end
Remote --> Manager: Map<ModelSource, List<RemoteFile>>
Manager -> Manager: Compare local files with remote
Manager --> UI: Update downloadStates (UpdateAvailable/UpToDate)

== Download Model ==
User -> UI: Select model checkbox
UI -> Manager: downloadModel(model)
Manager -> HF: Download .bin file
note right: Streams to local storage\nwith progress updates
Manager --> UI: DownloadState.Downloading(progress)
HF --> Manager: Complete
Manager -> Storage: Save model file
Manager --> UI: DownloadState.Completed

== Select Model ==
User -> UI: Tap downloaded model
UI -> PreferencesViewModel: setPreference(selectedModelId)
note right: Stored in DataStore

== Delete Model ==
User -> UI: Uncheck downloaded model
UI -> Manager: deleteModel(model)
Manager -> Storage: Delete file
Manager --> UI: Refresh file list

@enduml
